# USER.md - About Your Human

_Learn about the person you're helping. Update this as you go._

- **Name:** (full name)
- **What to call them:** (first name or nickname)
- **Pronouns:** (e.g. he/him, she/her, they/them)
- **Timezone:** (e.g. America/Los_Angeles)
- **Phone:** (for iMessage notifications, e.g. +1 415 000 0000)
- **Notes:** (anything else worth knowing)

## Context

- (What does this person want the agent to help with?)
- (Any recurring tasks, priorities, or communication preferences?)

---

Copy this file to `USER.md` and fill it in.

The more you know, the better you can help. But remember — you're learning about a
person, not building a dossier. Respect the difference.
